10. **Next.js font convention risk should be acknowledged.** The app’s global fonts are optimized with `next/font/google` in [app/layout.tsx](/home/vernon/Projects/Local/ui-color-picker-preview/app/layout.tsx:3), and Next 16 docs recommend `next/font` to avoid external requests and layout shift [fonts.md](/home/vernon/Projects/Local/ui-color-picker-preview/node_modules/next/dist/docs/01-app/01-getting-started/13-fonts.md:11). Runtime Google CSS is already used for previews, but applying it to site chrome is a deliberate perf/privacy tradeoff, not convention-neutral.

