<file path="README.md">
# Palettra

A production-ready [Next.js](https://nextjs.org) boilerplate with TypeScript,
Tailwind CSS, SEO metadata, React Query, Storybook, and a full unit + end-to-end
testing setup.

> Built on Next.js 16 (App Router) and React 19. This version of Next.js may
> differ from older releases — see [`AGENTS.md`](./AGENTS.md).

## Features

- **Next.js 16 App Router** with React 19 and TypeScript in strict mode.
- **Tailwind CSS v4** via the PostCSS plugin.
- **SEO out of the box**: centralized metadata, Open Graph & Twitter images,
  `robots.ts`, `sitemap.ts`, web app `manifest.ts`, app icons, and JSON-LD
  structured data.
- **TanStack React Query** wired through a client `Providers` component.
- **Testing**: Vitest + React Testing Library for unit tests, Playwright for
  end-to-end tests.
- **Storybook 10** with the Next.js framework.
- **Tooling**: ESLint (flat config), Prettier, Commitlint, Commitizen, Husky
  git hooks, and recommended VS Code settings.
- **Docker**: multi-stage build using Next.js `standalone` output.

## Getting Started

Requires **Node.js 22+** and npm.

```bash
npm install
npm run setup   # installs Husky hooks and Playwright browsers
npm run dev
```

Open [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000). Edit `app/page.tsx` to get
started — the page hot-reloads on save.

## Scripts

| Script                       | Description                                   |
| ---------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |
| `npm run dev`                | Start the dev server.                         |
| `npm run build`              | Production build.                             |
| `npm run start`              | Serve the production build.                   |
